{
  "movie_id": 220400201,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 11.7,
      "end_time": 12.6,
      "text": "Everyone!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 13.0,
      "end_time": 14.5,
      "text": "Once again, from the bottom of my heart!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 14.7,
      "end_time": 16.4,
      "text": "Thank you for taking care of me!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 16.6,
      "end_time": 19.4,
      "text": "How am I supposed to repay you?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 19.6,
      "end_time": 22.0,
      "text": "Don't worry about it, Kururu!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 22.3,
      "end_time": 23.2,
      "text": "*Nom*"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 24.6,
      "end_time": 28.2,
      "text": "Actually, that's not the end of it, is it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 28.6,
      "end_time": 32.3,
      "text": "We need to find out where those spiders came from"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 32.5,
      "end_time": 35.2,
      "text": "There's a risk of recurrence..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 36.2,
      "end_time": 40.4,
      "text": "And also the cause of monsters from the continent of Astraea coming here"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 40.5,
      "end_time": 42.1,
      "text": "What could it be...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 45.4,
      "end_time": 47.2,
      "text": "[As special treatment.]"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 47.4,
      "end_time": 48.2,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 49.2,
      "end_time": 51.0,
      "text": "[Shall I tell you what it is?]"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 55.3,
      "end_time": 56.4,
      "text": "Who is it!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 57.6,
      "end_time": 60.5,
      "text": "[I’m not one for introductions, but...]"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 62.0,
      "end_time": 63.3,
      "text": "[If you insist...]"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 64.6,
      "end_time": 67.3,
      "text": "[People call me Freiya]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 69.5,
      "end_time": 70.6,
      "text": "Freiya...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 71.3,
      "end_time": 73.5,
      "text": "[Feel free to inscribe it to your memory]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 74.0,
      "end_time": 78.1,
      "text": "[That said, I doubt it’ll be something worth remembering]"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 86.4,
      "end_time": 88.5,
      "text": "Wow, it's like a magic trick! ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 88.7,
      "end_time": 91.3,
      "text": "No, that's not it"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 91.6,
      "end_time": 93.0,
      "text": "...Should I stop her?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 93.5,
      "end_time": 94.5,
      "text": "It's all right"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 95.5,
      "end_time": 98.6,
      "text": "She shouldn't be able to do much from just projectional magic"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 99.5,
      "end_time": 100.5,
      "text": "Outside"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 100.7,
      "end_time": 101.6,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 110.0,
      "end_time": 110.9,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 111.1,
      "end_time": 112.2,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 115.1,
      "end_time": 117.3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 117.6,
      "end_time": 119.0,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 122.5,
      "end_time": 125.3,
      "text": "Large groups of monster are suddenly appearing...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 125.5,
      "end_time": 127.7,
      "text": "You there, what's the meaning of this?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 129.0,
      "end_time": 130.5,
      "text": "[Still don’t understand?]"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 132.0,
      "end_time": 136.7,
      "text": "[This is a declaration of war.]"
    }
  ],
